{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1060128-david-hill-has-left-opp-what-happens-to-changeling-now-changeling-is-still-happening","id":1060128,"title":"David Hill has left OPP: What happens to Changeling Now? [Changeling is still happening]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-08T09:20:54-08:00","id":1060128,"title":"David Hill has left OPP: What happens to Changeling Now? [Changeling is still happening]","content":"Code Red: Def Con 1: David Hill has left OPP: What happens to Changeling Now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T09:37:54-08:00","id":1060140,"title":"","content":"Given that it is written in its entirety... probably nothing. Someone will take over proofing, make the edits necessary and the book will likely get released, albeit a bit later than planned. Is it disappointing? Extremely. Is it a reason to freak out about this particular book? Don't think so. We're still going to get the awesome game that David developed, and I would be shocked if there were major revisions this late in the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" 